          "title": "沙发充电插座",
          "content": "<p>很多人喜欢坐在沙发上玩手机，但是常常找不到插座充电。</p>\n<p>因此，现在就流行一种新家具，是沙发后面装一个木架，木架上面有插座。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202405/bg2024051003.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202405/bg2024051004.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这个架子放在沙发后面，很简单就解决了找不到插座的问题。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202405/bg2024051005.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
