          "content": "<p>装水的保质期，指的是塑料瓶的保质期，而不是水的保质期。纯净水是不会变质的。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/does-bottled-water-go-bad-yes-but-it-probably-wont-harm-you-2023-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BusinessInsider.com</a></p>",
